        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KRB175, Solid Brass Large Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-3/4 Inch Solid Brass Large Cabinet Knob has a traditional style that makes it perfect for almost any home. The timelessness of this cabinet pull allows it to withstand the world of home-decorating and its ever-changing trends. We offer 8 different finishes for this cabinet knob. No matter which finish you choose, this cabinet handle will still be made of  high quality solid brass. It has a 1-3/8 inch diameter and has a 1-1/2 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KRB175-Specifications.gif?v=1704354782\" width=\"476\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KRB175 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large cabinet knob can be combined with either the <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc100\"><b>1\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-1-2-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc150\"><b>1-1/2\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KRB175 Large Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KRB175.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KRB175 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-3/4 Inch Solid Brass Large Cabinet Knob | Deltana KRB175",
                "description": "Solid Brass Large Cabinet Knob Deltana KRB175 - The 1-3/4 Inch Solid Brass Large Cabinet Knob has a traditional style that makes it perfect for almost any home. The timelessness of this cabinet pull allows it to withstand the world of home-decorating and its ever-changing trends. We offer 8 different finishes for this cabinet knob. No matter which finish you choose, this cabinet handle will still be made of  high quality solid brass. It has a 1-3/8 inch diameter and has a 1-1/2 inch projection.\r\n",
